# Allowlist: the build context contains only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Everything else, including private/, plans/, docs/, demo/, tests/, local
# secrets, and VCS metadata, never reaches the Docker daemon.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!mcp_gateway/
!mcp_gateway/**
!docker/
!docker/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
# Redundant with the allowlist; kept explicit so release gates can assert it.
private/
